dialect protocol
protocol gismap.spr
version 1
schema gis.map.mutation
start record
framing record
record gis.gismap-set-crs tag 1
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record gis.gismap-add-point tag 2
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record gis.gismap-tile-ref tag 3
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
chain hash u64
